<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 236-8 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 236-8 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL, South Africa 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe scored 236</p>
<p>for eight from their 50 overs in the day/night match against</p>
<p>India on Monday.</p>
</text>
